    {
      "id": 221359,
      "category": "researcher",
      "content": "During my research of zero day vulnerabilities in mobile applications, I found that it is possible to steal a user's session cookie through a malicious deeplink in KAYAK v161.1. Below, I will explain in detail what this vulnerability is, where it is located in the code and what steps need to be taken to replicate the exploit.\n\n* https://fluidattacks.com/blog/account-takeover-kayak/",
